<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices lower, ammonia steady - higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices lower, ammonia steady - higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were slightly weaker as export demand tapered off while ammonia values remained firm on tight supply and steady, light demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182		    dn 2-3</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     186-187		    dn 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   200-205		    flat-up5</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
